"• In the case of employee's absenteeism before or after the vacation without authorisation or a valid reason, there will be a deduction from their salary for the whole vacation.","clause_id":"92c3f451-7654-4bf6-9540-8433df4f27d5","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_92c3f451-7654-4bf6-9540-8433df4f27d5","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"1ae16710d87faa72":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"• In the event that an employee does not complete their one-year contract, they will be entitled to 2.5 days of vacation per month.","clause_id":"7cb7d35b-b599-40fc-8bcc-d0d98e37a42d","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_7cb7d35b-b599-40fc-8bcc-d0d98e37a42d","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"1bcbf939cb401157":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"• In terms of the contract, all Saudi employees, sponsored employees, or employees under (Ajeer System) are entitled to annual vacation leave.","clause_id":"1b565fc6-b009-4502-83e7-f9e90cd35f42","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_1b565fc6-b009-4502-83e7-f9e90cd35f42","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"255e11c1932a9516":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"• Company-sponsored employees are required to hand over their Iqama, medical card & driving license (if provided by company) prior to proceeding in and out of the Kingdom.","clause_id":"25b8343a-ae1f-45f6-83ea-50d13c376fa8","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_25b8343a-ae1f-45f6-83ea-50d13c376fa8","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"16a58793871da05e":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"All school employees must avail their leave during the summer vacation.","clause_id":"773d28df-d195-4ef6-b700-1684444debca","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_773d28df-d195-4ef6-b700-1684444debca","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"81568f8f9529b59d":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"Policy allows employees to carry over their vacation to the next year according to work necessity and interests.","clause_id":"2fa7765a-f503-4988-a26d-92269eaac922","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_2fa7765a-f503-4988-a26d-92269eaac922","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"422f97166cc64582":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"• Arab Schools encourages all employees to utilize and enjoy their annual vacation.","clause_id":"2fa7765a-f503-4988-a26d-92269eaac922","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_2fa7765a-f503-4988-a26d-92269eaac922","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"701689ed49040217":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"Additional days leave may be granted at the discretion of higher management by a formal request through the HR department.","clause_id":"773d28df-d195-4ef6-b700-1684444debca","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_773d28df-d195-4ef6-b700-1684444debca","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"37fd78e5fa3eaa6f":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"• Employees will take their vacation according to the leave roster.","clause_id":"2b1513a2-c042-4e2b-acd9-0181be395aa7","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_2b1513a2-c042-4e2b-acd9-0181be395aa7","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null},"1171f15ec41c0017":{"document_version_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f","text":"In addition, no employee will be allowed to take annual leave if they have not accrued the days required for a vacation.","clause_id":"773d28df-d195-4ef6-b700-1684444debca","search_document_id":"04780d6d-6c54-438a-b1ba-4e144ad1909f_773d28df-d195-4ef6-b700-1684444debca","source_hash":"a4ab80af24640509976881a36b76895b474558f3cb5a1b4fa564d0bf7faf07e9","page":12,"section":"7.12. ANNUAL VACATION","start_offset":null,"end_offset":null}},"facts":{"arab-schools":{"name":"arab-schools","source_phrase":"Arab Schools","data_type":null},"right-to-schedule-vacations":{"name":"right-to-schedule-vacations","source_phrase":"the right to schedule vacations","data_type":null},"there":{"name":"there","source_phrase":"there","data_type":null},"deduction-from-their-salary-for-the-whole-vacation":{"name":"deduction-from-their-salary-for-the-whole-vacation","source_phrase":"a deduction from their salary for the whole vacation","data_type":null},"before-or-after-the-vacation":{"name":"before-or-after-the-vacation","source_phrase":"before or after the vacation","data_type":null},"employee":{"name":"employee","source_phrase":"an employee","data_type":null},"per-month":{"name":"per-month","source_phrase":"per month","data_type":null},"all-saudi-employees-sponsored-employees-or-employees-under-ajeer-sys